# Overlapping cover-key presses: HOME pressed while NEXT is still held (40 ms into its 80 ms press).
# The cover keys are separate touch points on the controller (upstream: off-screen Y ~ 1600), so both
# presses must arrive: one page turn, then home, and leaving the book saves the reading position.
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 160dp          # 星星邮差
+3s      key   next
+40ms    key   home               # NEXT still held
+3s      snap  home
+500ms   end
